    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Digit arithmetic</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Carry propagation</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/plus-one/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 66</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Plus One</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">A carry only survives through 9s. Walk from the last digit: turn each 9 into 0, and the first digit below 9 takes the +1 and ends the work. Only all-nines grows the array, and then the answer is 1 followed by zeros. O(n) worst case, O(1) extra space.</p>\n"
  },
